15.2 OARF Refinement
The Orbital AI Readiness Framework now includes ten layers (0, 0.5, 1, 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, 5.5, 6, 7, 8), each scored 1–5. The aggregate score is:

\text{OARF} = \left( \prod_{i=1}^{N} S_i \right)^{1/N}, \quad N=12.

Maturity bands remain: <2.5 concept, 2.5–3.5 development, >3.5 deployment‑ready. First‑generation systems score 2.3–2.8; the next generation targeting 3.5+ requires resolution of the thermal scaling and systemic risk layers.

